<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Coal to issue Euroyen CB.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Coal to issue Euroyen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Sumitomo Coal Mining</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Banca del Gottardo</p>
<p> TYPE Euroyen convertible  ISSUE NO	   AMT   10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON NIL		    ISSU PRICE PAR   MATURITY 20.Sep.00</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CONV FROM 4.Oct.96    CONV TO 6.Sep.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 20.Sep.96    INT PAY</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE		 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI		 LAST NIS</p>
<p>The conversion price will be decided on September 4.</p>
</text>
